# CR 704.5y: if a permanent has two Role Auras controlled by the same player,
# the one with the later timestamp stays and the other goes to the graveyard.
# Two Monstrous Rages each create a Monster Role token attached to the Bears
# (CR 303.4i); after the second resolves only one Role stays.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 4 R
queue targets 5
castspell human 2
resolvestack
